WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.005
The moral of a sketch is a helpful value shown by what characters do and what follows

00:00:05.005 --> 00:00:05.853
from their actions.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:11.860
Which detail belongs in a short retelling? Answer: The central problem and how it was

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:12.204
solved.

00:00:13.033 --> 00:00:17.897
Act out someone returning a lost book; explain which value the action demonstrates.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:22.241
Discuss why: Important events help the retelling make sense.
